heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2993687096","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107812#issuecomment-2993687096","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107812","id":2993687096,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ycAo4","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-21T17:28:25Z","updated_at":"2025-06-21T17:28:25Z","body":"> Is this just a VSCode problem or is it other editors? If it is all of them then we could just change the existing line arg to be 1 indexed instead.\r\n\r\nI only use VS Code currently, so I can only speak for it. I don't recall hearing of editors using zero-based line numbers, so I'd be inclined to say the `line` arg could be one-based instead. I'd definitely prefer that personally, but I don't want to end up causing a bunch of problems for others if the line numbering is inconsistent across editors 😅 \r\n\r\nI don't know how long it'll take, but I'll see if I can go through those editors and figure out how they do line numbering.\r\n\r\n> This PR can also update these\r\n\r\nGood catch, thanks! I'll go add that to the PR for now, although my *hope* is that we can update the `line` arg instead and revert this new `{lineStart1}` thing.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2993687096/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2993699601","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107812#issuecomment-2993699601","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107812","id":2993699601,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ycDsR","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-21T17:59:24Z","updated_at":"2025-06-21T17:59:49Z","body":"I've gone through all of the editors listed in the docs (assuming Kate behaves the same as Geany) and checked their behavior. They all expect a one-based line number. (See the table in #107809)\r\n\r\nI'll try p